        <mxCell id="note" value="Every level must be completed before its checkpoint. At each checkpoint, the player chooses Easy, Medium, or Hard and must answer correctly before continuing. Wrong answers follow the Question Flow on page 2. Death/revival and Level 5 maze-entry checks are shown on page 3." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=14;size=18;align=left;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
